<!-- "Voir", the parliamentary open data (D-065; contract docs/integration/voir-donnees-ouvertes.md,
     sections 4 and 5): every member of the Assemblée nationale, the Sénat and the European
     Parliament elected in France, their groups and their votes. French, the user is addressed with
     "vous", typographic apostrophe (’), no em dash. Neutral words everywhere: the positions are
     written in full, never coloured, members never ranked. Never « données officielles » alone in a
     title (the licence of the Sénat forbids suggesting an official character). -->
